---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — GaiaVerity" desc="How GaiaVerity handles cookies, analytics, advertising, and your data.">

  <section style="background:#f7f5f0; padding:72px 24px 96px;">
    <div style="max-width:680px; margin:0 auto;">

      <p class="font-sans" style="font-size:11px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#c98633; margin-bottom:20px;">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="font-sans" style="font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,48px); font-weight:700; line-height:1.1; letter-spacing:-0.02em; color:#23312b; margin-bottom:24px;">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="font-serif" style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#5c7962; margin-bottom:40px;">Last updated: September 2026</p>

      <div class="font-serif" style="font-size:16.5px; line-height:1.85; color:#23312b;">

        <p>GaiaVerity ("we", "us", "our") operates <a href="/" style="color:#3B6D11;">gaiaverity.com</a>. This page explains what information we collect, how we use it, and the choices you have. By using this site you agree to the practices described here.</p>

        <h2 class="font-sans" style="font-size:22px; font-weight:600; color:#23312b; margin:36px 0 12px;">Cookies We Use</h2>
        <p>A cookie is a small text file stored on your device when you visit a website. We use cookies for a few reasons:</p>
        <ul style="padding-left:24px; margin:12px 0;">
          <li style="margin-bottom:8px;"><strong>Essential cookies</strong> — required for the site to function, including remembering your cookie preferences.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:8px;"><strong>Analytics cookies</strong> — help us understand how visitors use the site so we can improve it. We use Plausible Analytics (privacy-friendly) and Matomo.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:8px;"><strong>Advertising cookies</strong> — used by Google AdSense to serve and measure ads.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="font-sans" style="font-size:22px; font-weight:600; color:#23312b; margin:36px 0 12px;">Advertising (Google AdSense)</h2>
        <p>We use Google AdSense to display ads. Google, as a third-party vendor, uses cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visits to our site and/or other sites on the Internet.</p>
        <p>You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="noopener" style="color:#3B6D11;">Google Ads Settings</a>. For more on how Google uses data when you use our partners' sites or apps, see <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener" style="color:#3B6D11;">How Google uses data when you use our partners' sites or apps</a>.</p>

        <h2 class="font-sans" style="font-size:22px; font-weight:600; color:#23312b; margin:36px 0 12px;">Analytics</h2>
        <p>We use privacy-respecting analytics tools to understand aggregate traffic patterns — pages visited, approximate location, and referring sites. This data is used to improve content and is not used to personally identify you.</p>

        <h2 class="font-sans" style="font-size:22px; font-weight:600; color:#23312b; margin:36px 0 12px;">Data We Collect</h2>
        <p>We do not require accounts and do not collect personal information such as your name or email unless you choose to contact us. If you email us, we use your address only to respond to your message.</p>

        <h2 class="font-sans" style="font-size:22px; font-weight:600; color:#23312b; margin:36px 0 12px;">Managing Your Preferences</h2>
        <p>You can manage cookie preferences at any time via the cookie banner on this site. You can also control cookies through your browser settings, including blocking or deleting them. Note that disabling cookies may affect how some parts of the site function.</p>

        <h2 class="font-sans" style="font-size:22px; font-weight:600; color:#23312b; margin:36px 0 12px;">Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>Our articles may link to external sites (such as retailers or research sources). We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those sites.</p>

        <h2 class="font-sans" style="font-size:22px; font-weight:600; color:#23312b; margin:36px 0 12px;">Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about this policy? Email us at <a href="mailto:buzzUW2@gmail.com" style="color:#3B6D11;">buzzUW2@gmail.com</a>.</p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
